{
  "bookId": "hero-214201",
  "id": "bond-27523",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27523001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "这个地方很适合作为宝库呢，真的要送给我吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没错。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "人类……你对我那么好，是不是想要「那个」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "「那个」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "还装傻，就是缔结最后的契约啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "用你们人类的话来说，应该是叫做「结婚」吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……你理解这两个字的含义吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "当然，你竟然胆敢低估龙族的智慧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "将双方的命运、财产、以及生命，通过契约的方式紧紧联系在一起，这就是「结婚」吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27523011",
              "text": "没错，我想要！"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27523012",
              "text": "我没想过这件事……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27523010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "如果你想的话……那我也不是不能答应你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "没关系，吾应允了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "唔，按照人类的习惯，我以后是不是应该称呼你为老公了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27523014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "……老公？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
